      <strong>Top pick: Frida Baby NoseFrida.</strong> Fastest cleaning reset we measured (about 60–90 seconds), no motor noise, and the fewest parts to manage when you are half awake. Skip it if mouth suction bothers you, or if you do not want to keep buying hygiene filters.
    </blockquote>

