      <p><strong>What we measured and observed:</strong> cleaning reset about 60–90 seconds; no motor noise; parts are tube, collection chamber, mouthpiece, nasal tip, and a disposable hygiene filter. Parent-controlled suction can feel stronger than many portable electrics, and the whole kit packs small for travel.</p>
      <p><strong>Skip if:</strong> you are uncomfortable with mouth suction, or you do not want the ongoing cost and ritual of replacing hygiene filters.</p>
      <p><strong>Price:</strong> not verified in our affiliate library — <a href="https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00171WXII">check current price on Amazon</a> (plain link, not an affiliate link).</p>
      <p><a href="/tests/nosefrida-vs-grownsy-at-3am/">Read the 3AM pilot test →</a> · <a href="/tests/nosefrida-cleaning-reset-what-to-rinse/">Cleaning reset notes →</a></p>
    </div>

    <div class="pick-card">
